== Behavior ==
The '''Minotaur''' attacks at melee range. It can throw a slow-moving [[Axes|Axe]] at the player every {{Green|1.5s}}, which does damage but no {{Stat|knockback}}.

The '''Minotaur''' has a special mechanic: {{red|Bleed}}. The {{Red|Bleed}} count above the '''Minotaur's''' head increases by {{Red|1}} every time the '''Minotaur''' hits the player with a regular melee attack and by {{Red|3}} when the thrown Axe strikes the player. The {{Red|Bleed}} effect reduces [[Healing]]. Every {{Green|2}} seconds, the '''Minotaur''' strikes the player with {{Red|75x}} the {{Red|Bleed}} count. The {{Red|Bleed}} counter can reset if the '''Minotaur's''' {{Red|Bleed}} doesn't increase for {{Green|5}} seconds. If the {{Red|Bleed}} count reaches {{Red|27}}, the '''Minotaur''' runs away from the player, and the thrown [[Axes|Axe]] doesn't strike the player. This lasts until the Bleed count turns to {{Red|0}}.

