== Trivia ==
* If the player dies to a '''Minotaur''', the bleed stack counter can sometimes linger in the air. This is a visual-only bug and has no bearing on gameplay{{Confirm}}.
* The '''Minotaur''' is based on the [[w:Minotaur|Minotaur]], a creature with the head and tail of a bull and the body of a man from Greek mythology.
**Its {{Item|Daedalus Stick}} drop is based on the hollow wooden cow it was born in, which was made by [[w:Daedalus|Daedalus]].
* For a short time, the '''Minotaur''' had an OptiFine cape of the flag of Pakistan.

